        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Sheffield United F.C.\n- People: Dave Kitson, David Barry Kitson\n- Competitions: League One, English football play-offs\n- Topics: 2012–13 season, football careers\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2012–13 season, Sheffield United F.C. participated in League One, the third level of English football.\n- Sheffield United F.C. played in League One in 2012–13 because the club failed to win promotion after losing the previous season's play-off final.\n- David Barry Kitson was born on 21 January 1980.\n- Dave Kitson, whose full name is David Barry Kitson, is an English former footballer.\n- Dave Kitson played as a striker.",
